.TH snip-config-set 1  "snip 0.4.0" 
.SH NAME
snip\-config\-set \- Set one supported config key
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsnip config set\fR [\fB\-\-library\fR] [\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIKEY\fR> <\fIVALUE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Set one supported config key
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-library\fR \fI<LIBRARY>\fR
Library root. Falls back to SNIP_LIBRARY, ancestor discovery, then config
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR
Structured output mode for commands that return records
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
human
.IP \(bu 2
json
.IP \(bu 2
jsonl
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<COLOR>\fR
Color policy for terminal preview
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIKEY\fR>

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
default\-library
.IP \(bu 2
output
.IP \(bu 2
color
.IP \(bu 2
preview\-render
.IP \(bu 2
preview\-pager
.IP \(bu 2
editor
.IP \(bu 2
pager
.IP \(bu 2
default\-language
.IP \(bu 2
default\-folder
.IP \(bu 2
default\-tags
.IP \(bu 2
tui\-theme
.IP \(bu 2
tui\-light\-theme
.IP \(bu 2
tui\-dark\-theme
.IP \(bu 2
tui\-sort
.IP \(bu 2
tui\-density
.IP \(bu 2
tui\-line\-numbers
.IP \(bu 2
git\-auto\-commit\-interval
.IP \(bu 2
git\-auto\-push
.IP \(bu 2
git\-backup\-on\-quit
.RE
.TP
<\fIVALUE\fR>

